# Assistant content: a plain prose paragraph, no markdown syntax at all.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-plain.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /rate limiter middleware/ 20
SHOT reply
EXPECT /wraps every upload route/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
